WEBVTT

00:08:59.917 --> 00:09:02.809
Like Europe, China is another big player

00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:05.226
with a very distinct set of values,

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:08.268
or contract between
the people and the state.

00:09:08.292 --> 00:09:10.559
And I have to say that this set of values

00:09:10.583 --> 00:09:12.851
is not one that is well-understood

00:09:12.875 --> 00:09:14.143
in the West.

00:09:14.167 --> 00:09:18.476
And given China's extraordinary
economic and social transformation

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:20.184
in the last 30 years,

00:09:20.208 --> 00:09:21.809
we should really be more curious.

00:09:21.833 --> 00:09:25.143
China's values are rooted
deep in its history,

00:09:25.167 --> 00:09:27.434
in a desire to regain the place

00:09:27.458 --> 00:09:30.268
it once enjoyed hundreds of years ago